            <ArticleTitle>[Zosteriform leiomyomatosis--successful treatment by iontophoresis with tap water].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>923-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report on a 44-year-old male patient with zosteriform leiomyomatosis on his right back (paravertebral Th 10-L2), who suffered from severe pain, especially after thermal or pressure irritation, in this area. Treatment with iontophoresis using tap water resulted in a gradual relief from the pain.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
